    Add cache-buster ?v=3.010.400 to 344 unversioned styles.css refs (#1632)
    
    344 pages (mostly port pages) loaded /assets/styles.css with no version
    query string. Combined with the .htaccess `Cache-Control: immutable`
    policy the owner documented, these were permanently cached with no way to
    push CSS updates to returning visitors. Added ?v=3.010.400 — the site's
    current majority version (792 other pages already use it) — so these
    pages bust cache consistently with the rest of the site. 0 unversioned
    styles.css refs remain.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BQVDWGoyzkcEHZYcBerCjA

